OL,3,AKatya Adler: France's government under
OL,4,Apressure after weekend of widespread
OL,5,Aviolence
OL,6,
OL,7,FOver half a million mainly peaceful
OL,8,Fprotesters demonstrated on Saturday
OL,9,Fagainst rising living costs and
OL,10,Fdwindling access to decent public
OL,11,Fservices, including a good state
OL,12,Feducation. But the protests turned
OL,13,Fnasty after groups of black-clad,
OL,14,Fmasked activists and vandals appeared.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
